NNAAMMEE
       pbmtomda - convert a PBM image to a Microdesign .mda


SSYYNNOOPPSSIISS
       ppbbmmttoommddaa

       [--dd] [--ii] [----]

       [_p_b_m_f_i_l_e]


DDEESSCCRRIIPPTTIIOONN
       This program is part of NNeettppbbmm(1).

       ppbbmmttoommddaa  reads  a PBM image as input and produces a MicroDesign 2 area
       file (.MDA) as output.

       If you do not specify _p_b_m_f_i_l_e, ppbbmmttoommddaa uses Standard Input.


OOPPTTIIOONNSS
       In addition to the options common to all programs  based  on  libnetpbm
       (most notably --qquuiieett, see
        Common  Options  ⟨index.html#commonoptions⟩ ), ppbbmmttoommddaa recognizes the
       following command line options:



       --dd     Halve the height of the output file, to compensate for  the  as‐
              pect ratio used in MicroDesign files.

       --ii     Invert the colors used.

       ----     End of options (use this if the filename starts with "-")



LLIIMMIITTAATTIIOONNSS
       There's no way to produce files in MicroDesign 3 format. MD3 itself and
       mmddaattooppbbmm(1) can read files in either format.


